<title>USA: Ultrafem sees sales for FY97 about $3.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Ultrafem sees sales for FY97 about $3.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultrafem Inc said Tuesday it expects to report sales of about $3.5 million for the fiscal year 1997 ended June 30.</p>
<p>The company said it had revenue for the fourth quarter in excess of $1.95 million. The third quarter ended March 31 had revenues of $917,177.</p>
<p>The company completed an initial public offering in February 1996 and a secondary financing in November 1996.</p>
<p>Ultrafem is a women's health care company.</p>
</text>
